{
    "version": "10.21.0",
    "description": "SRK Toolbox - 用于加密、编码、压缩和数据分析的 Web 应用程序（基于 CyberChef），已翻译成中文",
    "notes": [
        "【工具类型】: 密码工具",
        "【主要功能】: 基于CyberChef的Web应用程序，支持加密、编码、压缩和数据分析，已汉化",
        "【适用场景】: 数据处理、CTF竞赛、密码学研究",
        "【技术特点】: 纯前端 Web 应用（CyberChef 汉化版），通过 uv 启动本地 HTTP 服务（端口 8992）访问",
        "【注意事项】: 启动后浏览器自动打开 http://127.0.0.1:8992；服务在新窗口运行，关闭该窗口即停止服务；首次运行 uv 可能需要下载 Python，请稍候"
    ],
    "homepage": "https://github.com/Raka-loah/SRK-Toolbox",
    "license": "UNKNOWN",
    "url": "https://github.com/Raka-loah/SRK-Toolbox/releases/download/v10.21.0/SRK_Toolbox_v10.21.0.zip",
    "hash": "de0ec1c05f8c375466a3999cea7b164aa3ff3d118df07b69931ea55e4f084e87",
    "suggest": {
        "python": "uv"
    },
    "pre_install": [
        "Get-ChildItem \"$dir\" 'SRK_Toolbox_v*.html' | Select-Object -First 1 | Rename-Item -NewName 'index.html'",
        "Set-Content \"$dir\\SRK-Toolbox.bat\" '@pushd %~dp0",
        "@start uv run python -m http.server 8992",
        "@start http://127.0.0.1:8992",
        "@popd' -Encoding Ascii"
    ],
    "bin": "SRK-Toolbox.bat",
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "SRK-Toolbox.bat",
            "SRK-Toolbox"
        ]
    ],
    "checkver": "github",
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://github.com/Raka-loah/SRK-Toolbox/releases/download/v$version/SRK_Toolbox_v$version.zip"
    }
}
